       \sum_{d\mid \widetilde{r}} \frac{\mu(d)^2}{\varphi(d)}G\left(\frac{\log dq}{\log R}\right)- \frac{\widetilde{r}}{\varphi(\widetilde{r})} G\left(\frac{\log \widetilde{r}q}{\log R}\right)&= \sum_{d\mid \widetilde{r}} \frac{\mu(d)^2}{\varphi(d)}-\frac{\widetilde{r}}{\varphi(\widetilde{r})}\\
