    We only consider the case $\Lambda(n)f(n+2)$, the other case being similar. We apply Theorem~\ref{thm:gallagher_application} with $P=P_0, R=R_0$ and let $E(n)$ be as in~\eqref{eq:roughappr1}. Discarding the sieve weights with Lemma~\ref{lem_twistsievechar}, we get
    \begin{align*}
        \|f^+(\Lambda - r_{P_0}-E)\|^{\wedge}_\infty &\ll D_1  N R_0^{-1/3}\ll N^{1-\delta_1^3/3+\delta_1^3/100}.
    \end{align*}
    By Lemma~\ref{lem_fourierimpliesapprox}  we obtain
    \begin{align*}
