 \mathfrak{c}(n) g_3(n)&\approx_{\widetilde{\epsilon}} \mathfrak{c}(n) \mathcal{V}(\Omega'_{\textup{M}}) \Lambda(n)\bigl(\omega -\Omega\bigr)(n+2).
